OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fmainly dry and rather cloudy with the
OL,7,Fbest of any cloud breaks across Moray.
OL,8,FA little patchy drizzle possible over
OL,9,Fthe hills with winds coming in off the
OL,10,FNorth Sea.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FIt will be mostly cloudy but
OL,13,Fgenerally dry, best of the brightness
OL,14,Facross Moray. A few showery outbreaks
OL,15,Fof rain possible, mainly over the
OL,16,Fhills. Moderate easterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
